sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Alice as Requester
  participant Bob as Reviewer
  participant Store as Evidence store

  Alice->>Bob: Original request
  Bob-->>Alice: Retained response
  Note over Bob: Verify the received records before relying on them
  Note over Alice,Bob: Both participants retain the complete original request and response before either copy is used as evidence

  activate Bob
  par Retain exact evidence
    Bob->>Store: Save original request and retained response
    Store-->>Bob: Stable evidence reference
  and Reproduce the finding
    Bob->>Bob: Re-run the deterministic validation
  end

  alt Evidence agrees with the retained response
    Bob->>Store: Record verified outcome
    Bob-->>Alice: Review can proceed with cited evidence
  else Evidence differs
    loop Until the discrepancy is explained
      Bob->>Store: Compare source, parser result, and rendered output
      Store-->>Bob: Return the same retained originals
    end
    Bob-->>Alice: Report the mismatch with the original evidence attached
  end
  deactivate Bob
